+// Connections dialled from the instrumentation's own cgroup, keyed as
+// own_cgroup_conn_key() (generictracer/own_cgroup.h) spells them. Written at
+// connect time and by the socket iterator, retracted when either end closes,
+// and read before any buffer on an instrumented socket is parsed.
+//
